{"4381040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MADDMADD", "steam_appid": 4381040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/fd3f61003e0f1a07b291c96bf139e21e.avif?t=1781603276\" width=920 height=430 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end in a single flash—it unraveled. Decades of corruption, resource hoarding, and political ego escalated into a brief but devastating nuclear war. Cities burned, governments vanished overnight, and the survivors inherited a planet of ash, rust, and silence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation, famine, and endless conflict reshaped humanity. Entire regions became uninhabitable. Communities fractured into nomadic clans, raider gangs, and isolated settlements clinging to the remains of the old world. Fuel, clean water, and ammunition became currencies - but none of them were truly rare anymore. Anything could be taken by force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider camps, warbands, and brutal enclaves dominate the desert routes. They kill, enslave, and burn anything that slows them down. Crossing the wasteland means pushing through them or dying where you stand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.poster.avif?t=1781603276\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.webm?t=1781603276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.mp4?t=1781603276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero, nor a conqueror. You are a wanderer - shaped by hunger, loss, and exhaustion. You kill because the wasteland enforces a single law: take, or be taken. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every raider camp wiped out is not justice - it’s momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MADDMADD is a third-person shooter taking notes from the likes of Mad Max, Quake, Doom, and Body Harvest, and is set to drench you in the browns and bloods of a bygone era. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/a79255ed046ba8f0cb2fd27d2ac08d02.avif?t=1781603276\" width=1200 height=638 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person Action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beefy Guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough as Nails Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusty Visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Original Soundtrack by MEAT SKULL!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/fd3f61003e0f1a07b291c96bf139e21e.avif?t=1781603276\" width=920 height=430 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end in a single flash—it unraveled. Decades of corruption, resource hoarding, and political ego escalated into a brief but devastating nuclear war. Cities burned, governments vanished overnight, and the survivors inherited a planet of ash, rust, and silence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation, famine, and endless conflict reshaped humanity. Entire regions became uninhabitable. Communities fractured into nomadic clans, raider gangs, and isolated settlements clinging to the remains of the old world. Fuel, clean water, and ammunition became currencies - but none of them were truly rare anymore. Anything could be taken by force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raider camps, warbands, and brutal enclaves dominate the desert routes. They kill, enslave, and burn anything that slows them down. Crossing the wasteland means pushing through them or dying where you stand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.poster.avif?t=1781603276\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.webm?t=1781603276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/11a5c2c8144137c73c4e31c8f1582b69.mp4?t=1781603276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero, nor a conqueror. You are a wanderer - shaped by hunger, loss, and exhaustion. You kill because the wasteland enforces a single law: take, or be taken. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every raider camp wiped out is not justice - it’s momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MADDMADD is a third-person shooter taking notes from the likes of Mad Max, Quake, Doom, and Body Harvest, and is set to drench you in the browns and bloods of a bygone era. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/extras/a79255ed046ba8f0cb2fd27d2ac08d02.avif?t=1781603276\" width=1200 height=638 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person Action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beefy Guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough as Nails Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusty Visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Original Soundtrack by MEAT SKULL!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "MADDMADD is a third-person run-and-gun boomer shooter with fast-paced movement, beautiful giblets and a comedic tone. Blow stuff up in your tank and then get up-close-and-personal with your boomstick!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/e8d80d48cc08f870408007c901fbf79ead7f8e50/header.jpg?t=1781603276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/838bd149b8ea9655d652ab8f47b002029516c2d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781603276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/838bd149b8ea9655d652ab8f47b002029516c2d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781603276", "website": "https://www.dosmangames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DallasDev"], "publishers": ["DOSMan Publishing"], "demos": [{"appid": 4384600, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381040/9babd136ff06e5